      "name": "Product Colorways",
      "settings": {
        "heading_text": "<high>Upgrade Your Foldable exercise bike<high></high></high>",
        "description_text": "Experience smoother, more challenging workouts with the new upgarded Ativafit F8 Foldable Exercise Bike. Enjoy a refreshed design, enhanced resistance control, and all the features you loved about the original F8—now upgraded for maximum home training performance.",
