            "question": "5. What does the Rush F8 Pro monitor track?",
            "answer": "The Rush F8 Pro digital monitor helps track time, speed, distance, and heart rate for general workout tracking. It also includes a phone holder, so you can keep your device nearby for music, videos, or simple workout guidance."
