            "question": "6. Is the Rush F8 Pro a spin bike?",
            "answer": "No. The Rush F8 Pro is not a studio-style spin bike. It is a foldable upright exercise bike for steady seated cardio, beginner-friendly home workouts, and compact storage—not standing sprints or high-intensity cycling classes."
          }
        },
