          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "7. What is the difference between Sprint F8 and Rush F8 Pro?",
            "answer": "The main difference is resistance control. Sprint F8 has 8 resistance levels, while Rush F8 Pro has 16 resistance levels for finer adjustment. Rush F8 Pro is a better fit for users who want more room to progress in their home cardio routine."
